<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>iV3Xz</Major>
    <Description>Hello hello!!! Are you looking for the grand prize Gehenna? Well, even though it's difficult to get - for free at least - there is a chance with BM boxes. You can farm them from MC lv6 and lv7. So the idea here is to leave a strong digi insta killing digimons that give MC lv6.

First, a few recommendations:
1) Have a Magnetic ID so you won't even have to work on grabbing all the loot. If you don't have it, just add a "4" on the macro so you pick them up.
2) Have a strong digi lvl 95+. This way, all your attacks will be crit (if you have a little bit of clone on crit), and you will insta kill every digi.
3) Regarding where to go, I recommend File Island Waterfront, where Volcamon is. Go to the upper right and leave the bot farming there.

Now, for the important part:
1) If you don't have a digi soul, leave a DS fruit on F5 so your digi doesn't devolve.
2) If you have enough energy Pills, put one on F6 so you will never get fatigued and that way you won't be reported.
3) I have already made a MC6 killing macro, feel free to look it up and use it!
4) I recommend farming at least 500 MC lv6, so you will get a lot of rewards. With the money from farming the monsters, you will also be able to buy MC lv6 from players. Do that too.

Anyway, that's all for today! Hope you get lucky and get Gehenna! Good luck!</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
